# Test-only env (PUBLIC values, safe to commit). Vitest/Vite loads .env.test for
# the "test" mode, populating import.meta.env.VITE_* at collection time so the
# suite can import components that transitively load lib/stacksClient.ts and
# constants/contracts.ts (both throw if these are unset on the mainnet build).
VITE_NETWORK=mainnet
